          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Stuck on a problem? Send a doubt request to any online mentor or peer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 shrink-0">
          <i data-lucide="trophy" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-slate-800">Compete & Climb</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Weekly algorithmic tournaments with live leaderboards and rankings.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SPECIAL MISSION SECTION: BRIDGING THE COMPETITIVE GAP -->
  <section id="mission-sec" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-24 border-t border-slate-200/30">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Majestic Interactive Co-Coding Mockup (6 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative w-full">
        <div class="absolute -inset-1.5 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-100/30 to-indigo-100/30 blur-2xl opacity-40"></div>
        
        <!-- Monaco Editor Styled Doubt Mockup -->
        <div class="relative w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-850 shadow-2xl p-6 space-y-5 select-none font-mono text-[11px]">
          
          <!-- Editor Title Header Bar -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 text-slate-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 ml-2">binary_search_optimization.py</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase text-indigo-400 tracking-wider">Live Pair Session</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Code Editor Body -->
          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-300">
            <div><span class="text-indigo-400">def</span> <span class="text-blue-400">findPeakElement</span>(nums):</div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;left, right = 0, len(nums) - 1</div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-slate-500"># Online peer Manoj is stuck here (Memory Quota Limit)</span></div>
            <div class="bg-rose-950/40 border-l-2 border-rose-500/80 py-1 px-2 text-rose-200 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;while left &lt; right:</span>
              <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-rose-400">⚠️ Heap Error (Test Case 48/50)</span>
            </div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;mid = (left + right) // 2</div>
            <div class="bg-indigo-950/40 border-l-2 border-indigo-500/80 py-1 px-2 text-indigo-200">
              <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold"># Expert Companion Alex optimized allocation:</span></span>
            </div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if nums[mid] &gt; nums[mid + 1]:</div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;right = mid</div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;else: left = mid + 1</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Active matching thread panel overlay -->
          <div class="bg-slate-850 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 font-black">Alex_Grandmaster (Mentor)</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold">Joined Room #4092</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed italic">
              "Hey Manoj! The heap issue happens because index mid calculation exceeds boundaries. Try dividing nums using bits instead. Fixed it in line 6!"
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Mission Statement Text (6 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">
          <span>Bridge The Programming Skill Gap</span>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-800 uppercase leading-none">Don't Code Alone.<br>Solve Together.</h3>
        
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
          Standard programming contests are highly intimidating. Beginners and intermediate coders are forced to compete against the elite rank #1s without having a pre-existing circle of expert friends to ask for help when they are stuck.
        </p>

        <!-- Dynamic Steppers showing resolution flow -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
          
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-black text-rose-500 shrink-0">1</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Spawn Sandbox Workspace</h5>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mt-0.5">Spin up a custom collaborative challenge room right from your dashboard in one click.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-black text-indigo-500 shrink-0">2</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Broadcast Doubt Request</h5>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mt-0.5">Stuck on complex algorithmic limits? Tap "Request Help" to notify active online mentors.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-black text-emerald-500 shrink-0">3</div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Conquer The Tournaments</h5>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mt-0.5">Optimize code lines together, beat the test cases, and climb up the leaderboard ranks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS STEP TIMELINE -->
  <section id="stepper-timeline" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-24 border-t border-slate-200/30">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-20 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Simple &amp; Fast</h2>
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-800 uppercase leading-none">Spin Up Multiplayer In Seconds</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        We designed CodeWith? to focus entirely on developer velocity. Zero local environment setup, zero container conflicts, just real-time pair programming.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Stepper layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12 relative">
