          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">Live Cursors</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">Delta Sync</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Small Feature (Span 5) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-white/70 border border-slate-200/50 rounded-3xl p-8 space-y-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Sandboxed Execution</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Every code submission runs inside isolated containers. When Docker is unavailable, a transparent bare-metal fallback kicks in — you never notice the difference.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Small Feature (Span 5) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-white/70 border border-slate-200/50 rounded-3xl p-8 space-y-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-500 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <i data-lucide="message-circle-question" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Instant Doubt Clearing</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Stuck on a problem? Broadcast a help request to active peers online. When someone accepts, they join your live workspace and debug alongside you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Large Feature (Span 7) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 bg-white/70 border border-slate-200/50 rounded-3xl p-8 space-y-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <i data-lucide="trophy" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Weekly Algorithmic Tournaments</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Compete in structured weekly contests with timed challenges, live leaderboards, and detailed performance breakdowns. Track your ranking over time, compare solutions, and level up your problem-solving skills consistently.
